			["7th Legion"] = { content = "The '''7th Legion''' is a group of [[Alliance]] veterans from past wars bent on fighting the threat of [[Naxxramas]] in the [[Dragonblight]].\r\nThe following is a quotation by [[High Commander Halford Wyrmbane]], leader at [[Wintergarde Keep]], regarding the nature of 7th Legion:\r\n''Through the valleys and peaks of [[Mount Hyjal]], across the shifting sands of [[Silithus]], against the [[Burning Legion|Legion's]] dread armies - we have fought. We are the nameless, faceless, sons and daughters of the Alliance. By the Light and by the might of the Alliance, the first strike belongs to us and the last strike is all that our enemies see.\r\nWe are 7th Legion.''\r\nThis statement indicates that the 7th Legion may be one of the most elite fighting forces within the Alliance armies, having participated in battles at least as far back as the [[Battle of Mount Hyjal]], and maybe even further.\r\nTheir incarnation during the [[War of the Shifting Sands]] was in the form of the [[Might of Kalimdor]]. Former Might of Kalimdor members [[Duke August Foehammer]], [[High Commander Lynore Windstryke]] and [[Highlord Leoric von Zeldig]] survived to fight on in Northrend.",},
			["7:XT"] = { content = "'''7:XT''' is a level 41 [[rare mob]] [[Gnomish Mech]] found in the [[Badlands]].",},
