			["Server:Azuremyst US/Crafting list/Jewelcrafting"] = { content = "The following is a listing of '''High End Crafting''' in [[Jewelcrafting]] for the server [[Server:Azuremyst_US|Azuremyst US]]. \r\nFeel free to add yourself to the list and try to keep your name in ALPHABETICAL order. \r\nAll patterns which create Bind on Equip items from Burning Crusade have been listed. \r\n== [[Jewelcrafting]]==\r\n<onlyinclude>\r\n===Helms===\r\n===Rings===\r\n===Meta Gems===\r\n===Red Gems===\r\n===Blue Gems===\r\n===Yellow Gems===\r\n===Purple(Red/Blue) Gems===\r\n \r\n===Orange(Yellow/Red) Gems===\r\n===Green(Blue/Yellow) Gems===\r\n",},
