			["Server:Azuremyst US/Crafting list/Tailoring"] = { content = "The following is a listing of '''High End Crafting''' in [[Tailoring]] for the server [[Server:Azuremyst_US|Azuremyst US (PvP)]]. \r\nAll patterns which create Bind on Equip items from Burning Crusade have been listed. \r\nIf you wish to be added, or there is a craftable item missing, please post on the realm thread I have created. \r\n== [[Tailoring]]==\r\n<onlyinclude>\r\n===Armor===\r\n===Bags===\r\n===Cloak===\r\n \r\n===Cloth Specialties===\r\n===Item Enchants===",},
			["Server:Blackhand US"] = { content = "===Realm Stats===\r\nRealm Type: PvE\r\nPopulation: High\r\nTransfer Eligibility: Open\r\nIRC:\r\nServer: irc.gamesurge.net |\r\nPort: 6667 |\r\nChannel: #Blackhand.US \r\n<!-- First Level 60: of <>, -->\r\nFirst Level 70: Neovingian of <Transcended>,\r\n===Burning Crusade Raid Progress===\r\n#'''Serpentshrine Cavern''': Due to non-linear positioning of bosses in this instance the following bosses will be listed inline until Lady Vashj is killed: Hydross, Lurker, Tidewalker, Fathom-Lord, Leotheras. Bosses ordered are based on relative distance to zone line.\r\n#'''The Eye''': Due to non-linear positioning of bosses in this instance the following bosses will be listed inline until Kael'thas is killed: Al'ar, Void Reaver, Solarian. Bosses ordered are based on relative distance to zone line.\r\n#'''Black Temple''': Due to non-linear positioning of bosses in this instance the following bosses will be listed inline until Mother Shahraz is killed: Shade of Akama, Gorefiend, Reliquary of Souls, Bloodboil. Bosses ordered are based on relative distance to zone line. Naj'entus & Supremus will be listed linearly, until one boss in the next set killed.\r\n===Guild Progress===\r\n</onlyinclude>",},
			["Server:Blackrock Europe"] = { content = "== [[Alliance]]==\r\n*[[Guild:Trollohren Sammler eV (Blackrock EU)|Trollohren Sammler eV]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Bladesong (Blackrock EU)|Bladesong]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:And Judgement for all (Blackrock EU)|And Judgement for all]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Moscher von Azeroth (Blackrock EU)|Moscher von Azeroth]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Mainframe (Blackrock EU)|Mainframe]] ()",},
			["Server:Blackrock US"] = { content = "A high population [[:Category:US servers|US server]]. Upon the release of WoW this server was chosen as the unofficial Australian PVP server by the Australian WoW community (also acknowledged by Blizzard in the Australian trial WoW DVD booklet, along with [[Server:Spinebreaker US|Spinebreaker]] and [[Server:Proudmoore US|Proudmoore]]). Since then [[:Category:Oceanic Time Zone servers|Oceanic realms]] have been released and many Australians have rerolled, slightly alleviating the long queues suffered by this realm. However, because of this history, Blackrock is still a harsh and unfriendly server when it comes to transfers or new players. \r\nThe unofficial motto of the server is \"''Blackrock is full, GTFO.''\" \r\nThe default accepted [[pug]] loot rules is to roll [[Need]] on all [[BoE]]s regardless of [[quality]].\r\nThis realm is infamous for the [[Server:Argent Dawn US|Argent Dawn]] [[gnome]] raids. These events would occur when the server has unbearable [[lag]] or goes down. Many, sometimes hundreds, of Blackrock players create level 1 gnomes on the Argent Dawn [[:Category:RP servers|role playing realm]] and raid [[Ironforge]], [[spam]]ming text in chat channels and annoying players. The majority of players joined a guild named <Blackrock Exiles>. This behavior greatly annoyed the Argent Dawn population and was discouraged by Blizzard. Contrary to popular belief this is not a valid roleplaying event. The Blackrock denizens sole purpose is to disrupt Argent Dawn, usually by creating characters with vulgar names and spamming the server's Alliance trade channels with sophmoric humor or [[atlasloot]] links of [[Thunderfury]]. Despite numerious complaints and petitions from the Argent Dawn community, the guild <Exiles of Blackrock> continues to exist on the server and Blizzard has taken little (if any) action against the guilty.\r\n==Play Times==\r\nBlackrock is primarily a Pacific Standard Time server - however, the largest chunk of the population is of an Oceanic player base so Blackrock's peak population times usually run at AEST (NSW/Sydney Time) or UTC/GMT +10 hours.\r\n==Server Transfers==\r\nThere has been 4 free server transfers as initiated by Blizzard from Blackrock to other lower populated servers.\r\n#Blackrock > [[Server:Daggerspine US|Daggerspine]] - March 2005\r\n#Blackrock > [[Server:Bloodscalp US|Bloodscalp]] - August 2005\r\n#Blackrock > [[Server:Frostwolf US|Frostwolf]] - October 2005\r\n#Blackrock > [[Server:Garithos US|Garithos]] - January 2006\r\n===Opening of Ahn'Qiraj===\r\n4 guilds, all of which are Alliance, completed the [[Scepter of the Shifting Sands]]. The [[Gates of Ahn'Qiraj]] are officially open on 27th February 2006, 2.13 am Blackrock server time.\r\nRedefined has disbanded as of late 2006. Rezguise has transferred to [[Death and Taxes]] on [[Server:Korgath US|Korgath]] in early 2006, and has since retired. [[Guild:Colony Raiders (Blackrock US)|Colony Raiders]] disbanded in mid-June 2006 and Nice joined [[Guild:Eminence (Blackrock US)|Eminence]]. Ex and Nice have both retired from playing [[World of Warcraft]] around May 2007.\r\n==Blackrock Links==\r\n*[irc://irc.enterthegame.com/blackrock irc.enterthegame.com #blackrock]\r\n* (Classic WoW)\r\n* (The Burning Crusade)\r\n=== [[Alliance]]===\r\n*[[Guild:Band of the Hawk (Blackrock US)|Band of the Hawk]]\r\n*[[Guild:BeggarS (Blackrock US)|Beggars]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Bushido Samurai (Blackrock US)|Bushido Samurai]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Convicted (Blackrock US)|Convicted]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Covenant of Steel (Blackrock US)|Covenant of Steel]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Decendants (Blackrock US)|Decendants]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Depth (Blackrock US)|Depth]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Desecrated Souls (Blackrock US)|Desecrated Souls]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Do Not Disturb (Blackrock US)|Do Not Disturb]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Dominion of Chaos (Blackrock US)|Dominion of Chaos]]\r\n*[[Guild:Elementium (Blackrock US)|Elementium]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Eleventh Hour (Blackrock US)|Eleventh Hour]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Eminence (Blackrock US)|Eminence]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Eternal Asura (Blackrock US)|Eternal Asura]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Eternal Requiem (Blackrock US)|Eternal Requiem]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:exXiles (Blackrock US)|exXiles]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Fallen Chapter (Blackrock US)|Fallen Chapter]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Fear Us (Blackrock US)|Fear Us]]\r\n*[[Guild:GrindinGamers (Blackrock US)|GrindinGamers]]\r\n*[[Guild:Hit Squad (Blackrock US)|Hit Squad]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Infinity (Blackrock US)|Infinity]]\r\n*[[Guild:Inquisition (Blackrock US)|Inquisition]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Insanity's Demize (Blackrock US)|Insanity's Demize]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Ministry NZ (Blackrock US)|Ministry NZ]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Nexus (Blackrock US)|Nexus]] \r\n*[[Guild:No MAAM (Blackrock US)|No MAAM]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Redefined (Blackrock US)|Redefined]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Six Pack (Blackrock US)|Six Pack]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Southern Cross (Blackrock US)|Southern Cross]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Stadium Arcadium (Blackrock US)|Stadium Arcadium]]\r\n*[[Guild:Tarsis Shriners (Blackrock US)|Tarsis Shriners]]\r\n*[[Guild:The Dark Ministry (Blackrock US)|The Dark Ministry]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:The Mystics Of Stormwind (Blackrock US)|The Mystics Of Stormwind]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Trollohren Sammler eV (Blackrock US)|Trollohren Sammler eV]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:The Holy Inquisition (Blackrock US)|The Holy Inquisition]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:We Hate Guilds (Blackrock US)|We Hate Guilds]] ()\r\n=== [[Horde]]===\r\n*[[Guild:AlterElectus (Blackrock US)|AlterElectus]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Atomic Monsters (Blackrock US)|Atomic Monsters]]\r\n*[[Guild:Blackout (Blackrock US)|Blackout]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Bloodlust (Blackrock US)|Bloodlust]]\r\n*[[Guild:Bloodstar (Blackrock US)|Bloodstar]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Dårk Wrath (Blackrock US)|Dårk Wrath]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Death Wish (Blackrock US)|Death Wish]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Epocalypse (Blackrock US)|Epocalypse]]\r\n*[[Guild:FTW (Blackrock US)|FTW]]\r\n*[[Guild:Get Juiced (Blackrock US)|Get Juiced]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Guild of IV (Blackrock US)|Guild of IV]]\r\n*[[Guild:Hidden Power (Blackrock US)|Hidden Power]]\r\n*[[Guild:Indoor Kids (Blackrock US)|Indoor Kids]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Keekles (Blackrock US)|Keekles]]\r\n*[[Guild:Mediocrity (Blackrock US)|Mediocrity]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Nemesis (Blackrock US)|Nemesis]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:One (Blackrock US)|One]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Order of Avalon (Blackrock US)|Order of Avalon]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Pandamonium (Blackrock US)|Pandamonium]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Peons Action Party (Blackrock US)|Peons Action Party]]\r\n*[[Guild:Phase Three (Blackrock US)|Phase Three]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:PvP Anonymous (Blackrock US)|PvP Anonymous]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:QED (Blackrock US)|QED]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Raging Primates (Blackrock US)|Raging Primates]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Undying Rage (Blackrock US)|Undying Rage]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Servants of KaelThas (Blackrock US)|Servants of KaelThas]]\r\n*[[Guild:Scarface (Blackrock US)|Scarface]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Sundercats (Blackrock US)|Sundercats]]\r\n*[[Guild:The Blood Talon (Blackrock US)|The Blood Talon]] \r\n*[[Guild:The Elite (Blackrock US)|The Elite]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:The Prophetic Order (Blackrock US)|The Prophetic Order]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Tyrannus (Blackrock US)|Tyrannus]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:vF (Blackrock US)|vF]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Wardens of Asylum (Blackrock US)|Wardens of Asylum]] ()\r\n*[[Guild:Darkhour Resurrection (Blackrock US)|Darkhour Resurrection]] ()",},
